{"unit_id":"zzjzzb__ai-memory#card-zh","repo":"zzjzzb/ai-memory","commit":"9208281522612ebb349dff2e1b7e07a9c7683def","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-memory 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的本地记忆插件，基于 Rust 与 SQLite 按项目保存工作、情景和档案记忆，并通过工具和系统提示词接入 Harness。它提供记忆写入、混合检索、删除、固定保留、显式整理及压缩能力，也可在每轮提示词中自动预取符合 token 预算的相关记忆。核心逻辑使用 Rust crate，插件优先连接 napi 原生模块并在缺少时回退到 CLI。适合需要跨轮保留项目背景、减少重复说明并控制上下文长度的 DSH 用户；不需要 API 密钥，数据保存在本地 SQLite 数据库。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/dsh-ai-memory/src/index.js:14-76","integrations/dsh-ai-memory/src/tools.js:10-26","src/lib.rs:44-68"]}
{"unit_id":"zzjzzb__ai-memory#card-en","repo":"zzjzzb/ai-memory","commit":"9208281522612ebb349dff2e1b7e07a9c7683def","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ai-memory adds local project memory to DeepSeek Harness with Rust and SQLite. Tools save, recall, delete, pin, consolidate, and compact notes. Automatic prefetch adds relevant memories to the prompt within a token budget. It uses a native addon or the ai-memory CLI. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/dsh-ai-memory/src/index.js:14-76","integrations/dsh-ai-memory/src/tools.js:10-26","src/lib.rs:44-68"]}
